    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85980" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be drunk,</i>
			
